### 抢一张票，订单会写入数据库
POST http://localhost:18083/api/orders/grab
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 400,
  "sessionId": 101,
  "ticketCategoryId": 1001
}

### 查询订单，运行前把 1 替换成抢票接口返回的 id，预期 PENDING_PAYMENT
GET http://localhost:18083/api/orders/1

### 支付订单，运行前把 1 替换成抢票接口返回的 id
POST http://localhost:18083/api/orders/1/pay

### 再次查询订单，运行前把 1 替换成抢票接口返回的 id，预期 PAID
GET http://localhost:18083/api/orders/1
